    "detailed_description": "Neon defense is a minimalistic tower defense game with elements of a puzzle game.<br />\r\nYou have to beat waves of enemies to defend a map.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe twist between this and normal tower defense games is that enemies in this games have special abilities which make it necessary to find a way how to beat them. In most maps you cannot simply build a defense line with towers, you also need to analyse the enemies and find a way how you can beat them. Use 4 different towers and their special attack way, aiming with the mouse and mouse gestures to defend the maps against the enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is easy to learn but hard to beat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- 20 levels + 3 Bosses<br />\r\n- Easter Egg<br />\r\n- Around 30 different enemies, half of them with special abilities to defend theirselfs.<br />\r\n- Minimalistic design<br />\r\n- 3 Difficulties<br />\r\n- Steam Achievements<br />\r\n- 4 different towers, each comes with 3 upgrade tiers<br />\r\n- 1 Special Tower only in Boss level<br />\r\n- Cloudsave",
    "about_the_game": "Neon defense is a minimalistic tower defense game with elements of a puzzle game.<br />\r\nYou have to beat waves of enemies to defend a map.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe twist between this and normal tower defense games is that enemies in this games have special abilities which make it necessary to find a way how to beat them. In most maps you cannot simply build a defense line with towers, you also need to analyse the enemies and find a way how you can beat them. Use 4 different towers and their special attack way, aiming with the mouse and mouse gestures to defend the maps against the enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is easy to learn but hard to beat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- 20 levels + 3 Bosses<br />\r\n- Easter Egg<br />\r\n- Around 30 different enemies, half of them with special abilities to defend theirselfs.<br />\r\n- Minimalistic design<br />\r\n- 3 Difficulties<br />\r\n- Steam Achievements<br />\r\n- 4 different towers, each comes with 3 upgrade tiers<br />\r\n- 1 Special Tower only in Boss level<br />\r\n- Cloudsave",
    "short_description": "Neon Defense is a minimalistic classical tower defense game with puzzle elements. Build towers to defend yourself against the attacking enemies. Can you beat every level on hard?",
